{"2909960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kopi", "steam_appid": 2909960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KOPI had three special editions since the Early Access launch! We are thrilled to finally shout here about our Halloween, Christmas, and Chinese New Year special stories. Each story comes with two new levels and brings the familiar KOPI play to some very special occasions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/extras/880ec61cebf3de6cc8e0ef2348098c96.avif?t=1775224653\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/extras/337d1fe5a727df9c54d59f6310656f04.avif?t=1775224653\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/extras/e8df02671576291ca19355fd3d7bca8f.avif?t=1775224653\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KOPI, a family-friendly cooking game that can be enjoyed solo or with friends in co-op mode. In KOPI, you'll craft increasingly elaborate drinks and dishes for ever-demanding customers. Whether you're brewing, cooking, frying, cleaning, or serving, remember: it’s not over until the customer leaves happy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Cafés</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/extras/4cac245d4d6c42a27029e209a5e1b16c.avif?t=1775224653\" width=1486 height=1118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a coffee alchemist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew lattes, americanos, mochas, and whip up breakfasts and snacks that dance on the taste buds. Get the kitchen ready, roll up your sleeves, and let the customers pour in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play for Laughs</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the kitchen where the score doesn’t matter, but the laughs are endless. It's all about the fun and ridiculousness of what you can cook up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Pro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel your inner barista and race against the clock to serve as many drinks and dishes as possible, aiming for that elusive 3-star rating. Whether you’re a master chef or a kitchen calamity, there’s room for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Recipes:</strong> Mix and match ingredients to create dishes and drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments:</strong> Explore different café settings, each with unique challenges and charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Team up with friends locally or online for cooperative gameplay that doubles the fun and the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playful Visual Style:</strong> Delight in a playful visual style that transforms each scene into a charming miniature world.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to KOPI, a family-friendly cooking game that can be enjoyed solo or with friends in co-op mode. In KOPI, you'll craft increasingly elaborate drinks and dishes for ever-demanding customers. Whether you're brewing, cooking, frying, cleaning, or serving, remember: it’s not over until the customer leaves happy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Cafés</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/extras/4cac245d4d6c42a27029e209a5e1b16c.avif?t=1775224653\" width=1486 height=1118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a coffee alchemist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew lattes, americanos, mochas, and whip up breakfasts and snacks that dance on the taste buds. Get the kitchen ready, roll up your sleeves, and let the customers pour in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play for Laughs</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the kitchen where the score doesn’t matter, but the laughs are endless. It's all about the fun and ridiculousness of what you can cook up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go Pro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel your inner barista and race against the clock to serve as many drinks and dishes as possible, aiming for that elusive 3-star rating. Whether you’re a master chef or a kitchen calamity, there’s room for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Recipes:</strong> Mix and match ingredients to create dishes and drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments:</strong> Explore different café settings, each with unique challenges and charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos:</strong> Team up with friends locally or online for cooperative gameplay that doubles the fun and the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playful Visual Style:</strong> Delight in a playful visual style that transforms each scene into a charming miniature world.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Step into a cute cozy cafe where you brew, cook, fry, clean, and serve quirky customers. Every level starts off as a charming &amp; cozy world, but you and the customers bring the chaos. Unlock new levels as you play and earn coins, but remember: it's not over until every customer leaves with a smile!", "supported_languages": "English, Czech, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Malay", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/1e4ba535bb0fd6b073c5262c8ced88c6e70a739d/header.jpg?t=1775224653", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/dcbce3ff1d47a7fc3011e14eaa9aae08752f8949/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775224653", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909960/dcbce3ff1d47a7fc3011e14eaa9aae08752f8949/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775224653", "website": "https://dreamonastick.com/kopi", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11, 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 Core, 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX580, GTX1060, Intel UHD 770, Ryzen Vega 11<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11, 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6 Core, 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX7600, RTX4060, Intel Xe<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><stro